          %p These sets are taken to be equipped with the following group structure.
          #ProductOnSimplicialHomotopyGroups.num_defn
            %h6#definition_3 Definition
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
